        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ok, nvm, had a look in the source and found:\r\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.comment/blob/9ead47cef4266efa5145808b838762c658b74f74/lua/mini/comment.lua#L17-L18\r\n--- What it doesn't do:\r\n--- - Block and sub-line comments. This will only support per-line commenting.\r\n\r\nThat should definitely be part of the README. Or rather: why is this out of scope?",
